      "key": "K0002",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 40: from about 05:00 to 09:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:19 I passed through Mill Road; around 09:25 I passed through the square; from about 09:30 to 17:15 I was at the clinic; around 17:16 I passed through the square; around 17:22 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:30 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:05 I passed through Mill Road; around 18:11 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:07 I passed through the square; around 22:13 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 56460,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
