      "key": "K0037",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 40: from about 05:00 to 15:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 15:15 I passed through the square; from about 15:15 to 23:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 23:04 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 56460,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
