      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 40: from about 05:00 to 07:15 I was at home; around 07:14 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
