      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 40: from about 05:00 to 08:15 I was at home; around 08:19 I passed through the square; around 08:25 I passed through Mill Road; from about 08:30 to 14:15 I was at the mill; around 14:20 I passed through Mill Road; around 14:26 I passed through the square; from about 14:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
