      "key": "K0184",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 40: from about 05:00 to 07:15 I was at home; around 07:13 I passed through the square; around 07:19 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:30 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:17 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:23 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
