      "text": "On Day 40: from about 05:00 to 08:15 I was at home; around 08:10 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 17:15 I was at the workshop; around 17:11 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 20:15 I was at home; around 20:16 I passed through the square; from about 20:15 to 22:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:02 I passed through the square; from about 22:00 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
