      "in": "K0276",
      "key": "K0277",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 40: from about 05:00 to 08:15 I was at home; around 08:14 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:16 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 18:00 I was at the grocery; around 18:03 I passed through the square; around 18:05 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:00 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 19:18 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:13 I passed through the square; around 22:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 56460,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
